{"parentUuid":"a0423916-08f6-4a3a-b5a1-77c3395bbb5a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfwwu8wZJrzMc46FH7be1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, every item in that evaluation looks like that, and it's my fault.\n\n**Why it looks empty:** I added whole story traces to the evaluation, not individual verdicts. The top-level span of a story trace (`create-storybook`) had no input or output recorded, so neatlogs shows `{}` and `null` with \"173 steps\". The questions are about verdicts, which live in the `verify:*` spans inside the trace. Right now you'd have to click \"Open trace\" and dig through the steps for each of the 19 items.\n\n**Fixes:**\n- **Future traces:** the top-level span now records the request (lesson, age, arm, picture setting, repair cap) and the result (outcome, the receipt line, counts, broken promises). The change is committed as `0bfeecc` and tests pass.\n- **This evaluation:** I want to rebuild it so each item is one verdict span, with the promise, the quoted text and the judge's reason visible on the item itself. Your 4 submitted answers stay on record, since I'd only close the old evaluation.\n\nThe rebuild needs a new neatlogs sign-in, because the last one expired after an hour. **Please approve this one (valid 10 min):** https://app.neatlogs.com/oauth/device?user_code=AMV5-4YG4-5V66-ERGD\n\nUntil the rebuilt evaluation appears, please pause labeling the old items. I'll tell you when it's ready."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":137802,"output_tokens":463,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens"